00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:06,632
This is Volt. A city e-bike, stripped to what matters.

2
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:13,973
The battery hides inside the down tube. Eighty kilometres on one charge.

3
00:00:14,150 --> 00:00:18,130
A two hundred and fifty watt hub motor. Silent, and sealed.

4
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:22,140
Hydraulic disc brakes. Sure stops, even in the rain.

5
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:32,416
Seventeen point four kilos. Ready when you are.
